  "uncertainties": [
    "KOF '98 is an MVS cartridge/kit, not a unique factory-dedicated big-red cabinet. The selected SNK shell/panel variant is disclosed rather than inventing character sides.",
    "The original-design English mini-marquee occupies one of four MVS bays. Other bays remain blank; this skin runs only kof98, not a multi-game selector.",
    "One cabinet side photograph supplies generic Neo Geo/MVS/SNK logos on both sides with readable orientation; the opposite original print is unverified.",
    "Two black Start buttons remain photographed in the overlay. Both stations have four modeled A/B/C/D action buttons; all four are used by this game.",
    "The panel character instruction strips sit above the Start strip in the photo and are not stretched across the red deck; the mini-marquee retains the operator action diagram.",
    "Neo Geo BIOS is required and reused from the already supplied local neogeo.zip. Nine-coin startup state does not auto-start a match.",
    "Publisher-hosted artwork masters were not found. Archive artwork/photo rights remain uncertain; the MVS photograph retains Beeblebrox CC BY-SA 3.0 attribution and underlying SNK artwork rights."
  ],
